abstract: >-
  Automation pipeline connecting Instagram content publishing to qualified
  WhatsApp conversations, built on the Instagram Graph API and the WhatsApp
  Cloud API and orchestrated with n8n. Includes idempotent publishing with
  media container polling, webhook signature verification, explainable lead
  scoring, a consent gate enforcing the WhatsApp 24 hour service window, a
  durable job queue with dead letters, and an audit trail.
